<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Chase Kester — Cybersecurity Engineer</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0c0f;
    --bg2: #111418;
    --bg3: #181c22;
    --surface: #1d2229;
    --border: #2a3040;
    --border2: #3a4558;
    --text: #e8ecf2;
    --muted: #8a95a8;
    --faint: #4a5568;
    --accent: #2c7be5;
    --accent2: #1a5fb5;
    --gold: #daa520;
    --gold2: #b8891a;
    --green: #22c55e;
    --red: #ef4444;
    --mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    --sans: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --radius: 8px;
    --radius-lg: 14px;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.03'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    height: 60px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: rgba(10, 12, 15, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav-logo { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .nav-links a.blog-link { color: var(--accent); }
  .nav-links a.blog-link:hover { color: var(--text); }

  main { padding-top: 60px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  section { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 5rem 2rem; }
  section.wide { max-width: 1060px; }

  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .section-label::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border); max-width: 60px; }

  h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

  #home {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
    padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 4rem; align-items: start; }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow::before { content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 20px; height: 1px; background: var(--accent); }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; }
  .hero-tagline { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .hero-bio { font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 560px; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .hero-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .tag { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; padding: 4px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: 4px; color: var(--muted); background: var(--bg2); }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 9px 20px; border-radius: var(--radius); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s; border: 1px solid transparent; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent2); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--muted); border-color: var(--border2); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--border2); background: var(--surface); }

  .hero-terminal { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; min-width: 280px; max-width: 300px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .terminal-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg3); }
  .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .dot-r { background: #ff5f57; } .dot-y { background: #febc2e; } .dot-g { background: #28c840; }
  .terminal-title { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .terminal-body { padding: 16px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; line-height: 2; }
  .t-prompt { color: var(--green); } .t-cmd { color: var(--text); }
  .t-out { color: var(--muted); } .t-out.highlight { color: var(--gold); }
  .t-cursor { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 14px; background: var(--accent); vertical-align: middle; animation: blink 1.1s step-end infinite; }
  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

  .scroll-hint { margin-top: 4rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; color: var(--faint); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  .scroll-arrow { width: 20px; height: 20px; border-right: 1px solid var(--faint); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); transform: rotate(45deg) translateY(-3px); animation: bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes bounce { 0%,100%{ transform: rotate(45deg) translateY(-3px); } 50%{ transform: rotate(45deg) translateY(0); } }

  .divider { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; }
  .about-text p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 15px; }
  .about-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .about-text strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
  .about-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1px; background: var(--border); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  .stat-card { background: var(--bg2); padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
  .stat-num { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .stat-num .accent { color: var(--accent); } .stat-num .gold { color: var(--gold); }
  .stat-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--faint); }

  .timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
  .timeline-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr; gap: 2rem; padding-bottom: 2.5rem; position: relative; }
  .timeline-item::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 180px; top: 8px; bottom: 0; width: 1px; background: var(--border); margin-left: calc(2rem / 2 - 0.5px); }
  .timeline-item:last-child::before { display: none; }
  .timeline-date { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); letter-spacing: 0.05em; padding-top: 3px; text-align: right; }
  .timeline-content { padding-left: 2rem; position: relative; }
  .timeline-content::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: -4px; top: 8px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); border: 2px solid var(--bg); }
  .timeline-role { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .timeline-company { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .timeline-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .timeline-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .tl-tag { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; padding: 2px 8px; background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 3px; color: var(--faint); }

  .projects-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .project-card { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.5rem; transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: block; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .project-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(44,123,229,0.04) 0%, transparent 60%); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s; }
  .project-card:hover { border-color: var(--border2); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .project-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .project-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .project-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .project-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .project-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .project-tag { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--faint); }
  .project-arrow { position: absolute; top: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem; color: var(--faint); font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
  .project-card:hover .project-arrow { color: var(--accent); transform: translate(2px, -2px); }

  .certs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .cert-card { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; transition: border-color 0.2s; }
  .cert-card:hover { border-color: var(--border2); }
  .cert-badge { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .cert-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); }
  .cert-issuer { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); }

  .skills-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
  .skill-group h3 { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  .skill-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .skill-item { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .skill-item::before { content: '→'; color: var(--border2); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; }

  .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; }
  .contact-text p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .contact-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .contact-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem; background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .contact-link:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--border2); background: var(--surface); }
  .contact-link-icon { width: 28px; height: 28px; background: var(--bg3); border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .footer-copy { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .footer-links a { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.05em; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--muted); }

  #network-wrap { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  #net-canvas { width: 100%; height: 320px; display: block; }
  .net-controls { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg3); flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .net-btn { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; padding: 5px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: 4px; background: transparent; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .net-btn:hover { background: var(--surface); color: var(--text); }
  .net-btn.danger { border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.4); color: var(--red); }
  .net-btn.danger:hover { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1); }
  .net-stats { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; }
  .net-stat { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); }
  .net-stat span { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  /* Blog preview section */
  .blog-preview-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
  .blog-preview-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1.5rem 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2rem; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s; }
  .blog-preview-item:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
  .blog-preview-item:hover .blog-preview-title { color: var(--accent); }
  .blog-preview-meta { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: center; }
  .blog-preview-tag { background: rgba(44,123,229,0.12); color: var(--accent); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .blog-preview-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .blog-preview-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 55ch; }
  .blog-preview-arrow { color: var(--faint); font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 4px; transition: color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
  .blog-preview-item:hover .blog-preview-arrow { color: var(--accent); transform: translate(2px, -2px); }
  .blog-all-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .blog-all-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-terminal { max-width: 100%; min-width: 0; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .timeline-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.25rem; }
    .timeline-item::before { display: none; }
    .timeline-date { text-align: left; }
    .timeline-content { padding-left: 1rem; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    section { padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem; }
    .blog-preview-item { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo"><span>~/</span>chase-kester</div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">about</a></li>
    <li><a href="#experience">experience</a></li>
    <li><a href="#projects">projects</a></li>
    <li><a href="#certs">certs</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">contact</a></li>
    <li><a href="/blog" class="blog-link">blog</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<main>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section id="home">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">Cybersecurity Engineer — NEPA / Remote</div>
        <h1>Chase<br>Kester<em>.</em></h1>
        <div class="hero-tagline">// Trust No Packet</div>
        <p class="hero-bio">
          Security operations engineer with 3+ years in enterprise cloud/hybrid security.
          I build detection logic, respond to incidents, and automate away the boring stuff —
          all while making sure humans stay the strongest link, not the weakest.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="tag">Microsoft Defender XDR</span>
          <span class="tag">Sentinel SIEM</span>
          <span class="tag">Incident Response</span>
          <span class="tag">PowerShell</span>
          <span class="tag">Azure</span>
          <span class="tag">WDAC</span>
          <span class="tag">Purview DLP</span>
          <span class="tag">Security Automation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch →</a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/chasekester" class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-hint">
          <div class="scroll-arrow"></div>
          scroll to explore
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-terminal">
        <div class="terminal-bar">
          <div class="dot dot-r"></div>
          <div class="dot dot-y"></div>
          <div class="dot dot-g"></div>
          <span class="terminal-title">bash — chase@kester</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <div><span class="t-prompt">❯</span> <span class="t-cmd">whoami</span></div>
          <div class="t-out">chase_kester</div>
          <div><span class="t-prompt">❯</span> <span class="t-cmd">cat certs.txt</span></div>
          <div class="t-out">SSCP · Sec+ · Net+ · A+</div>
          <div class="t-out">ITIL4 · Linux · NSE 1–3</div>
          <div><span class="t-prompt">❯</span> <span class="t-cmd">echo $STACK</span></div>
          <div class="t-out highlight">Defender · Sentinel · Entra</div>
          <div class="t-out highlight">Purview · Burpsuite · Qualys</div>
          <div><span class="t-prompt">❯</span> <span class="t-cmd">ping trust</span></div>
          <div class="t-out">PING trust: 0 packets trusted</div>
          <div><span class="t-prompt">❯</span> <span class="t-cursor"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="section-label">01 / About</div>
    <h2>The person behind the packets</h2>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>I'm a cybersecurity engineer at a large dental equipment distribution company where I own security operations end-to-end: from SIEM tuning and incident response to phishing simulations and WDAC policy rollouts.</p>
        <p>My experience with technology spans the full Microsoft security stack — Defender XDR, Sentinel, Purview DLP, Entra ID, and Intune — plus tools like Arctic Wolf, NinjaOne, AppTrana WAF, Barracuda WAF, Burpsuite Pro, and more.</p>
        <p>Outside the SOC: I run <strong>Legacy Etch LLC</strong>, a laser engraving business, and <strong>Trust No Packet</strong> — a cybersecurity-themed blog and public education platform.</p>
        <p>Based in Scranton/NEPA. Open to remote security roles.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">3<span class="accent">+</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Years in security</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num"><span class="gold">7</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Certifications</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">62<span class="accent">%</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Phish click reduction</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">1<span class="accent">k</span><span class="accent">+</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Incidents resolved</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- EXPERIENCE -->
  <section id="experience">
    <div class="section-label">02 / Experience</div>
    <h2>Where I've worked</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-date">Feb 2024 — Present</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <div class="timeline-role">Cybersecurity Administrator</div>
